# Project Reference

At the start of every chat session, read `PROJECT_REFERENCE.md` in the repo root to load full project context (architecture, directory structure, state management, design system, conventions).

When your work changes any of the following, update the relevant sections of `PROJECT_REFERENCE.md` before finishing:

- Directory structure (new files, renamed or deleted modules)
- Application flow (new routes, changed pipelines, new services)
- State shape (new context fields, removed keys)
- Design system (new tokens, templates, vibes, widgets)
- API routes or middleware changes
- Deployment or infrastructure changes
- Completed work items (move from "Pending" to "Completed Work")

Keep updates concise and factual. Do not rewrite unchanged sections.
